<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20297" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόλος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw with a casting-net</i>,
			Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.62
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγα δίκτυον ἐς β.
			ἕλκει</span> draws it back for <i>a cast</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.40
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς β. καθίστασθαι,
				ἔρχεσθαι</span>, fall within <i>the cast</i> of the net,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				848
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
				730
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>net</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				7.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				8.3
			</span></i>; for birds, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.184
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Zos.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>thing caught</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθύων β.</span>
			<i>draught, catch</i>, of fishes, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				424
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.91c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόλον ἀνσπάς ασθαι</span> land
			one's <i>catch</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				582
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>casting of teeth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				576b13
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				748b9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταμαθεῖν τὸν β.</span> examine
			a horse's <i>teeth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>Facet.</u>
				37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>cast of dice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.204
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plaut.
				<u>Rud.</u>
				360
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόλος: θύρα, πηλός</span> (i. e.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βῶλος</span>). <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
